# Git Workflow

- **G1** On "start a feature / bugfix / ticket", create a branch **before** writing code.
- **G2** Branch names: `feature/<ticket-or-desc>` or `bugfix/<ticket-or-desc>`. Preserve ticket IDs exactly. Description: lowercase, hyphen-separated, max 4–5 words.
- **G3** Always `git checkout main && git pull origin main` before branching — never branch from a stale base.
- **G4** If already on a non-main branch when a new feature is mentioned, ask whether to finish the current branch first.
- **G5** Conventional Commits: `feat|fix|chore|refactor|test|docs|style|perf|build|ci|revert`.
